{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining RNA (scvi_n200) and image (resnet50) data with concat fusion, aiming to assess the impact of image data on performance. The validation accuracy (0.536) and F1 (0.515) are lower than the best RNA-only baseline (0.653), suggesting image data may not improve performance in this configuration. However, the lack of comparisons to alternative fusion methods or detailed analysis of image modality contributions leaves the exact role of multimodal integration and design choices uncertain."
}

